      "title": "UGC-NET re-exam results for English, Commerce, Sociology announced",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/education/news/ugc-net-re-exam-results-for-english-commerce-sociology-announced-126091800336_1.html",
      "description": "The National Testing Agency on Friday declared results for re-examination of UGC-NET papers for English, commerce and sociology.\nThe NTA had last month announced the retest for the three papers of the UGC-NET June 2026 examination following complaints about several errors in these papers.\n\"UGC NET June 2026 Examination Results Declared for English, Commerce, and Sociology. Candidates can view and download their score cards through the official website,\" the National Testing Agency (NTA) said in a post on X.\nThe English paper was held on September 9 from 9 am to noon in first shift, while the commerce paper was conducted the same day from 3 pm to 6 pm in second shift.\nThe sociology paper was held on September 10 from 9 am to noon in first shift.\nThe NTA conducted the UGC-NET June 2026 examination from June 22 to 30 across 87 subjects for the award of Junior Research Fellowship (JRF), eligibility for assistant professor, and admission to PhD programmes.",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-09-18T07:05:04"
    },
    {
      "title": "UGC NET Re-Exam Result 2026 released at ugcnet.nta.nic.in, check details",
